<title>FRANCE: Filipacchi Q1 sales 375.1 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Filipacchi Q1 sales 375.1 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					   375.1  vs 373.0</p>
<p>     Of which magazines/advertising	    295.0  vs 321.0</p>
<p>     Diversification				  80.1  vs  51.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Publisher Filipacchi Medias gave the figures in the Official Bulletin (Balo).</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
